// ── phase-column codec (shared by `issues` + `features`) ──────────────────────────
// `arr_to_json` / `json_to_arr` are shared with skilldb via `bsc_sqlite_util` (#1621); the
// phase-column codec below is plan.db-specific (a raw JSON value, not a string list).

